{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "99b4621d9f58c36b2f89ff2460a8b2260d772ebf7fb915c0705e49dd767ad039", "ja": "感動必至！　真のドッキリ", "zh": "感动常在！货真价实的整蛊", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f840e0b516587013ac5ca817c113585ebd3a7b5b24b3cb74d87c58b68cf78297", "ja": "特番最終収録日。紗代子はプロデューサーに\n自分はアイドルになる事に必死で、友達付き\n合いをおろそかにしていたかもしれないと\n話す。だが番組内のVTRで友達の言葉を\n聞いた紗代子は、笑顔を見せるのだった。", "zh": "特别节目的最后录制日。纱代子对制作人说，自己或许一心想成为偶像，而忽视了和朋友相处。可是，在节目中听到朋友们的话后，纱代子露出了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9e73d88775c29e67f2a1e51af0da64a399e3c1762db7d7855efed3ff78679266", "ja": "（今日は短期特番、最終回の収録だ。\n全員で、有終の美を飾れるといいな……！）", "zh": "（今天是短期特别节目的最终回录制。希望大家都能为节目画上圆满的句号……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "8ff0284b5cc27c7970d7333013b31f8e91c98637f0aa293f77cf9956cd03d6ee", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "efe3f06040c5e1eaa33d5ae863f40aa0776d35ea1fb3508edd64cf04af4d232a", "ja": "お疲れ様……って、あれ？　紗代子だけか？", "zh": "辛苦了……咦？只有纱代子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "426cf50de8a7d4f57c057c3ec005720f5c552a2ea6a6d378d5ba23223e01fdde", "ja": "はい、ふたりは先にスタジオに行ってます。\nリハーサル前に、色々確認しておきたいからって。", "zh": "是的，她们两个人先去摄影棚了。  \n因为想在彩排前确认一下各种事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "5d2784aecfc4c66f7a13fc4f61e6dc59947e183086aaecefbcb31411ed324518", "ja": "私は、ひとりで考えたいことがあって……。", "zh": "我有些事情想一个人想想……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "313bd8989039e9f1406320ca3036d58a32bf3f75b7151ce8cced9aaf2af28b54", "ja": "考えたい事……もしかして、\n番組の事で何か引っかかってるとか？", "zh": "你想考虑的事……难道是节目有什么让你在意的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "acc47aec1e9d46cb9f2d99f4626f30198b712f40981220aa43e1f62fa0eea4b3", "ja": "あ、いえ！\nそうじゃないんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，不是！\n不是那样的，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "5122ffeab991c4bce3fe2ac21379749fdcf1b8c50b05efda40b111be2b59367d", "ja": "茜ちゃんも恵美ちゃんも、友達のこと、\n色々考えてるんだなって思ったんです。", "zh": "我觉得，小茜和惠美，为了朋友，都考虑了很多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ff44c8f425132197cd0b0d3f9e4e9cbaacc18b1673bfe6136edd8fdf8e8fe82c", "ja": "友達の事？", "zh": "朋友的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "cc37822d40a4c29eb9ea96db5ccab16d849e1222a009de3c3e13c8f12d38cc2a", "ja": "はい。私はそんなふうに、ちゃんと\n考えたことなかったかもしれないなって……。", "zh": "是的。我可能从来没有那样认真地想过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "392d87a1ee2202b53968f96bb66fd8d1113366acf207f7dc9a4d8d0a881d784b", "ja": "正直、アイドルになるまでそのことで頭がいっぱいで。\nなってからも、結局アイドルのことばかりで……。", "zh": "说实话，在成为偶像之前，我满脑子想的都是那件事。成为偶像之后，结果也还是光想着偶像的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "baed5edc63b516485901fa035381217c87386aa9ea63fc67d51e6a9fc9169189", "ja": "私、ふたりに比べたら、普通の友達付き合いを\n疎かにしてたから。友達が少ないのかなって……。", "zh": "跟她们两个比起来，我一直忽视了普通朋友之间的交往。所以朋友才会比较少吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0070bc9fdeb76c2b0cdc87548247aa6903a0cf919afc06074775362073cb0ed6", "ja": "たしかに茜と恵美は、友達が多そうだけど……。\nあのふたりは、特別多いほうじゃないか？", "zh": "确实，茜和惠美看起来朋友很多，不过……她们两个也不算特别多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cc15d432dc3cea1388830ded73e92b32b0deae8ebb3514273d46523fbf70f1ba", "ja": "それに、紗代子が友達付き合いを\n疎かにしてるとは思えないけどな。", "zh": "而且，我不觉得纱代子会疏于和朋友来往啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "9f369182da75a6f3ea9773e52e3fae2db69fbd4f60a3862964a1b755834fa228", "ja": "そうですか……？", "zh": "是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "32356060b928eef04109ce0ed45b74bd3eec54bd93d14300b833e9f2974a8b20", "ja": "ああ。友達といっても、人によって付き合い方は\n違うし。正解も不正解もないというか……。", "zh": "啊。虽说都是朋友，但每个人相处的方式都不一样。也就是说，并没有所谓正确或错误……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1016_se", "source_sha256": "9bcabd031b0ee079a2b4c3e7973b5036bfa7d09eb44dd4e45971561142189a34", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ！", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1017_staff", "source_sha256": "755714709a81d6015c01b888540c62da0c89c00de98f3b4c8388506b6400a304", "ja": "すみませーん！\n高山さん、そろそろリハ始まります！", "zh": "不好意思——！\n高山小姐，彩排差不多要开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "72615be500e3e3e6ea5e7c73705d843057a68f6bc9f6f0c8f2b61b3b2fc367dd", "ja": "あっ、はい！\nすぐ行きます！", "zh": "啊，好的！\n我马上就来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "95b94c4a4a6b8b74519f71ab26557f326d2c5daef4803a98f9d12b6719c7dc98", "ja": "おっと、もうそんな時間か。\nできればもう少し話したかったけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，已经到这个时间了吗？  \n如果可以的话，本来还想再聊一会儿的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "7657306acda97b6d42d4876403e1b9f72f9795ca92f20fa669429a2b80b82c94", "ja": "大丈夫です！　{$P$}と\n話したら、すこし気持ちが楽になりました。", "zh": "没关系的！和{$P$}聊过之后，\n我的心情轻松多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "cf2962c67967a0d059357603d3adb2ed2e39294ad43616a762ea7d48ce7c1f5b", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n行ってきますね！", "zh": "谢谢您。\n我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "662f4e3429cb7f8666ad8c4e094c8c42e0ef2d83d7b4ec12abaf32f488dcb651", "ja": "（そして、最後の企画『抜き打ちコールでウラ話！』\nが始まった。トップバッターは、恵美だ！）", "zh": "（然后，最后一个企划“突击打电话爆料趣事！”开始了。第一个上场的是惠美！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1023_meguminoyuujina", "source_sha256": "ac1a96d34c4457f98504bfeeed36c74e945642ffe050d7642a09caba5f3f8f8b", "ja": "「恵美のウラ話か～……あ、あれだ！\nメッセージの未読が1000超えてるってヤツ」", "zh": "「惠美的幕后八卦啊～……啊，有了！\n就是未读消息超过1000条的那件事」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "868545a6dfbf744c68c62a63d5eb9484eca378943bb2ceb18aaba5de1086b3d8", "ja": "はいはいはーい、異議あり！　それはカラオケとか\nファミレスとか、お店のメッセージだけだから！", "zh": "好啦好啦——我有异议！那只是卡拉OK店、家庭餐厅之类的店铺消息而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "3a0b9a7a282a641e2ab970f20d6cce3ace7b1e892a1e44d5a7480d1b0c5f0630", "ja": "アタシが友達からのメッセージを\n未読にするわけないっしょ～？", "zh": "我怎么可能把朋友发来的消息留着不读嘛～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1026_meguminoyuujinb", "source_sha256": "a3895565647a9bbb0855f80ce6f243362d2ae2f4cad65bc925e912e51a09b52c", "ja": "「それはそうだけど、\nいくらなんでも雑すぎん？っていう」", "zh": "“话是这么说，\n但这也太敷衍了吧？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1027_meguminoyuujinc", "source_sha256": "09a55f4afce7eef68dca46c4fcb7807ee55d8ba1e8e57a47d02f27bb866d9cf0", "ja": "「恵美の雑エピソード、多いよね～。こないだとか、\nお昼ご飯忘れたからコレでいいや、って……」", "zh": "“惠美的随便小八卦可真多呢～。之前也是，\n说什么忘了带午饭拿这个凑合下就行，结果……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "974dee33aa62d4a21ec8b9112e1e8e0a4dc55df45e2ba8bd2714d9cf34fa02a7", "ja": "ストップ、ストッープ！　もう！　みんな\nアタシのコト知りすぎてて、やりづらいって～！", "zh": "停，停——！真是的！你们也太了解我了，搞得我很难办啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1029_akanenoyuujina", "source_sha256": "fbd3fbcabf4ef13a484bb88f349b324eb12fa4dfd1815e1b7faf96707f3ac671", "ja": "「野々原さんのエピソード……\n意外と気遣いが細やかとか、そういう感じの？」", "zh": "「野野原小姐的事迹……\n像是意外地心细体贴，这类的感觉吗？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "72297b9f39c6de48acf4b3f16c398c49741140b9ad4e16986d3f0beddf015622", "ja": "おっ、わかってるぅ～！　そうそう、そういうの、\nそういうのもっとプリーズ！", "zh": "哦，很懂嘛～！对对，就是这种，\n这种请再多来一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1031_akanenoyuujinb", "source_sha256": "a07dc7f579edb514e549f3a79bef08ff73df7fa39b4acb64829c383a25ea1ed4", "ja": "「ノリがいいのも、変に気を遣わせないためって\nいうか。あと、男子のファンも多いよね？」", "zh": "“她很放得开也是为了不让人瞎操心吧。\n而且，男粉丝也挺多的呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "1b2f778d4116306765446795fcfaa092a064d25288029369ea5879f394ed3ae0", "ja": "そう！　茜ちゃんって、そういうタイプ！\nアイドルだから、惚れちゃダメだゾ☆", "zh": "没错！小茜就是这种类型！\n人家可是偶像，所以不可以喜欢上我哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1033_akanenoyuujinc", "source_sha256": "050c93dba144523517ada4ba1321526b81f92364c7acb50be795fed37823a923", "ja": "「周りとか全体をいつも見てて、でも自分をちゃんと\n持ってて、変に合わせたりはしない感じ」", "zh": "“总是关注着周围和整体，但又有自己明确的\n主见，绝不会随波逐流的那种感觉”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "a175babfc91a0c406897943f23f350a27dd7d4a407166ee40aceae8c8ea9fd73", "ja": "そ、そうそう、そうなんだよね……ニャハ……。", "zh": "对、对对，就是这样……喵哈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1035_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "4fa3df0fc44df38ecbbf706fbc0486acd7dd2abf4e2ec8f3873d2792ce22f91f", "ja": "「自由気ままなキャラっぽくても、本当は誰に\n対しても優しくて……尊敬してるよ、野々原さん！」", "zh": "「虽然看起来是个随心所欲的人，但其实对谁都很温柔……我很尊敬你，野野原小姐！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "ecba649d5e670535287469379741a0bb135cf5fc141a0dc75ccc0cbfab74a1e8", "ja": "ギギ、ギニャー！？　褒めすぎだって！\nムズムズする～！　もっとイジっていいから！！", "zh": "吱吱、喵——！？你夸得太过头啦！\n浑身痒痒的～！再多捉弄我一点也没关系！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1037_sayokonoyuujina", "source_sha256": "30272694345b59f050ba5a1c1058232f0380457dc3f59dcbe523a77949d4fcf2", "ja": "「紗代子のエピソードかぁ……。\nうーん……」", "zh": "“纱代子的剧情啊……  \n嗯……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1038_sayokonoyuujinb", "source_sha256": "4cbef7d3778ffd1c7635171e9b40110a057c239b1bcfd49ad04dcaa6013b212f", "ja": "「そんなにぱっと思いつくものがないかも。\n普段から、アイドル一直線だし」", "zh": "“可能一时半会儿还真想不出什么呢。\n毕竟平时我一直是一心扑在当偶像上”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "23ba76986c74ff6bf46964130c418f7ed02d1248afcec71aa073dd629630d3ed", "ja": "あ、あはは、そうだよね……。", "zh": "啊，啊哈哈，说得也是呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1040_sayokonoyuujina", "source_sha256": "582136d8f5fc0f3754dd7faf7a39225ddae92994248adc2abd9eb7fada0ee26f", "ja": "「でも、いつもすごく努力してるのわかるよ。\n大変そうだもんね、アイドルなんて」", "zh": "「不过，我知道你一直都在非常努力。\n毕竟，当偶像很辛苦嘛。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1041_sayokonoyuujinb", "source_sha256": "b3b5b4f53fce29f200ca9ca4ec114b3e82a810ddad0a41d85f1d2cb5c6ed8054", "ja": "「なのに、学校のイベントにも積極的だし。\n合唱コンのリーダーとかもしてくれたよね？」", "zh": "明明是这样，你还积极参加学校的活动。\n之前还担任过合唱比赛的负责人，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1042_027say", "source_sha256": "e0c6889f3a3c1ac071babe4cdb592e51807cf4e9fdda221d059f543ac1f0a831", "ja": "あ、そうだね。だって、せっかくの行事だから。", "zh": "啊，是啊。毕竟是难得的活动嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1043_sayokonoyuujina", "source_sha256": "a418e5bf8f79b945153b789f942ae98ab0126c513d2be74178c01216d2a6ce29", "ja": "「うん。アイドルも全力で、学校のイベントも全力！\nそれが紗代子なんだよね！」", "zh": "「嗯。当偶像全力以赴，学校的活动也全力以赴！\n这才是纱代子嘛！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1044_sayokonoyuujinb", "source_sha256": "a1108d8be6f48bf36858d5645eddadc16f23678a55f0bbec914448f97371e99f", "ja": "「紗代子は、その方が落ち着くみたいだから、\nいつも任せちゃってるんだけどさ」", "zh": "“因为纱代子好像那样更自在，所以一直都交给她来做。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1045_027say", "source_sha256": "b690401b9f5599eddb0c989e5a4f77e4daf7518a68c21081e401b4347e5cb618", "ja": "それはそうだね。\n常に全力の方が、私はやりやすいかも。", "zh": "确实如此。\n一直竭尽全力的话，对我来说可能更容易发挥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1046_sayokonoyuujina", "source_sha256": "c6d9a1a7f2b0015a6025327f6f4b331498062b63f66fb0fc57eb8e866e9a0f54", "ja": "「うん。でもね……あのさ……」", "zh": "「嗯。不过呢……那个……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1048_sayokonoyuujina", "source_sha256": "6a37cb7122c390b4c000c50dfed48b606a91e88a5897c714043946d78aa7178a", "ja": "「もっと、頼って欲しいかも。紗代子って、\n誰にも言わないで、ひとりで頑張っちゃうから」", "zh": "「我可能希望你……能更多地依赖我一点吧。\n因为纱代子你总是谁也不告诉，一个人默默努力」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1049_sayokonoyuujinb", "source_sha256": "90ee804365b8422e64e905b15377aa4622d80be1128b06ddab980113d68d3a93", "ja": "「だよね～。すごいことなんだけどさ……。\n私たちだって紗代子のこと、応援したいんだよ？」", "zh": "「就是说嘛～。虽然确实是件很了不起的事……\n但我们也想支持纱代子呀？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1051_sayokonoyuujina", "source_sha256": "3ffde0b07475f11e184982c1c349ab99786e2df0571dbf383778416592f23859", "ja": "「はー、急にゴメンね、マジな感じで。でもこれ、\nずっと言いたかったんだよね。言えてよかった！」", "zh": "「哈啊，突然这么严肃，抱歉啦。\n不过这话我一直都很想说呢。能说出来真是太好了！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1052_027say", "source_sha256": "336cfb652a885caeb3502d3065b4e35673c41fe21976ae4b3a6add7d085333dc", "ja": "私……ううん！　私も、聞けてよかった。\nそんな風に思ってくれてたんだ……", "zh": "我……不对！我也很高兴能听到这些。\n原来你一直是这么想的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1053_sayokonoyuujinb", "source_sha256": "067830f5568aac48af17107404f2036ed50a68ec120aa1829b043eba3b85ecc1", "ja": "「だから学校でも、もっと色々言ってよね。\n愚痴とかも聞くし、遠慮しなくていいから」", "zh": "所以在学校里也多跟我说说各种事情吧。\n有什么牢骚我也会听的，不用客气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1054_sayokonoyuujina", "source_sha256": "e6c77aac0c400a7656e712616dd25c504eb5ceb99e6e8b2d6f19b539094ecf3f", "ja": "「そうそう。私たちだって、紗代子のこと\n応援してるんだからさ。全力でね！」", "zh": "「没错没错。我们也是\n会为纱代子加油打气的哦。全力以赴呢！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1055_027say", "source_sha256": "22462a35fb2724ec3ca653806c776ccfee4d80142b50ce08b99b04adfc670baa", "ja": "うん……ありがとう！　そしたら、\n全力で甘えちゃうかも？　なんて、あはは♪", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你们！那样的话，\n我也许会全力向你们撒娇哦？开玩笑的啦，啊哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_05_1056_p", "source_sha256": "526675c7ad82814f241a9b7c02d6d75691dcb160171a28f27b2fc5c701d5279a", "ja": "（紗代子の表情が、柔らかなものになった……\nこれなら心配なさそうだな。いい番組になりそうだ！）", "zh": "（纱代子的表情变得柔和起来了……这样看来应该不用担心了。一定会成为一档很棒的节目！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
